ATTRIBUTION TO THE UPSTREAM SOURCE (ADIF BPA)

The dataset artifacts are derived from the publicly available price
catalog of ADIF (Administrador de Infraestructuras Ferroviarias),
published through the BPA portal at https://bpa.adif.es/bp1/. The raw
BC3 (Base de Costes de la Construcción, version 3) records were parsed,
expanded, deduplicated, and annotated by the authors to produce a
benchmark suitable for retrieval evaluation. The processed artifacts
distributed here are an original contribution by the authors; the
underlying construction work items, parameter values, and technical
specifications remain the intellectual property of ADIF.

The terms under which ADIF publishes the BPA catalog have not been
verified at the time of this release. The authors release their
processed artifacts under CC-BY-4.0 under the good-faith assumption
that the BPA catalog is made available for public reuse with attribution,
consistent with Spanish Law 37/2007 on the reuse of public-sector
information (BOE-A-2007-19814) and its successors. Downstream users
who plan to redistribute or transform large portions of the underlying
ADIF data are encouraged to contact ADIF directly (info@adif.es) to
confirm the applicable terms.

